1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,500
A humming that changes

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,000
when you steer? Not your tires.

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,200
Wheel bearing noise gets louder

4
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:07,200
turning one way, quieter the other.

5
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:09,000
You're loading the bad side.

6
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,800
Tire noise doesn't do that —

7
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:15,000
it stays the same through the turn.

8
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Ignore it, and a bearing won't get better.

9
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
It can seize — the wheel can lock up.

10
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,300
Send this to someone whose car hums.

11
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:26,000
Nick's Tire and Auto — link in bio.
